{"sections":[{"slug":"调和形式","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"调和形式"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">调和形式</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“调和形式”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">实的情形</span></h2>\n<p>Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">流形上的微分形式的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Laplace算子","text":"Laplace <span lang=\"zh\">算子</span>"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">定义为</span> $\\triangle = (d+\\delta)^2$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\delta$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $d$ <span lang=\"zh\">的伴随</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">由定义</span>, $d+\\delta$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $\\triangle$ <span lang=\"zh\">为自伴算子</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">调和形式是指满足</span> $\\triangle \\mu=0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的微分形式</span> $\\mu$. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $\\triangle \\mu=0$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span>\n$$\r\n0=(\\triangle\\mu,\\mu)=((d+\\delta)\\mu,(d+\\delta)\\mu),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">故</span> $(d+\\delta)\\mu =0$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">复的情形</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">复流形上</span> $\\alpha$ <span lang=\"zh\">是调和</span> $(0,1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">形式当且仅当</span>\n$$\r\n\\bar\\partial \\alpha = 0, \\quad \\bar\\partial ^* \\alpha = 0.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}